## The Rise of Non-Invasive RF Treatments

Non-invasive aesthetic treatments are the fastest-growing segment in the global aesthetics market. Radiofrequency (RF) technology sits at the center of this growth, driven by patient demand for effective treatments with minimal downtime.

The numbers tell a compelling story:
- The global aesthetic device market reached **$15.9 billion in 2024** and is growing at 10.2% CAGR
